 \reviewcomment{2.8} \textbf{Translation overhead is unclear.} Table VIII reports ``Cost/TS'' and ``Time/TS'' but does not specify the unit of measurement (e.g., USD per test suite? seconds per test suite?) or the size of the test suite being translated. Additionally, the paper does not compare MORPH's end-to-end translation time and LLM cost with previous methods such as SEDAR.
